[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0163","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0163.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1126","title":"FreeType BDF字体属性数据处理不当致远程代码执行漏洞","description":"FreeType 2.4.9之前版本在处理BDF字体的属性数据时存在内存破坏漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统提交特制的BDF字体文件触发无效堆读取操作，导致内存损坏，进而造成拒绝服务或在受影响系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响Mozilla Firefox Mobile 10.0.4之前版本、Apple iOS 6.0之前版本及其他使用FreeType的产品，CVSS评分10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1126"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T10:10:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:39:04Z","remediation":"将 FreeType 升级至 2.4.9 或更高版本。对于使用 FreeType 的产品（如 Mozilla Firefox Mobile），升级至 Firefox Mobile 10.0.4 及以上版本。Apple iOS 用户升级至 iOS 6.0 及以上版本。Linux 发行版用户通过包管理器更新 freetype 包（如 apt upgrade freetype）。如无法立即升级，可在应用层面对 BDF 字体文件的解析进行输入校验，拒绝畸形属性数据的 BDF 字体。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00002.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00003.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00004.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-04/msg00015.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0467.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48508","http://secunia.com/advisories/48758","http://secunia.com/advisories/48797","http://secunia.com/advisories/48822","http://secunia.com/advisories/48918","http://secunia.com/advisories/48951","http://secunia.com/advisories/48973","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201204-04.xml","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:057","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-21.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/03/06/16","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52318","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026765","http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1403-1","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=733512","https://bugzi