以上版本；Thunderbird 升级至 12.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.4 及以上版本；SeaMonkey 升级至 2.9 及以上版本。无法立即升级时，建议禁用 RSS/Atom 自动加载功能或使用内容安全策略（CSP）限制外部资源加载作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/48920","http://secunia.com/advisories/48922","http://secunia.com/advisories/48972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49047","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2457","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2458","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2464","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:081","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-33.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53224","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=714631","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75156","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A17011","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2012/CVE-2012-0479.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-0479.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0479.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-0479.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0479","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0479","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-0479.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0479","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-0479","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0479.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0064","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0064.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0478","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey WebGL texImage2D 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 的 WebGL 子系统中 texImage2D 实现存在类型转换漏洞，未正确限制 JSVAL_TO_OBJECT 的强制类型转换操作。远程攻击者可通过构造特制网页诱导用户访问，触发内存破坏，导致应用程序崩溃或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 4.x 至 11.0、Firefox ESR 10.x 低于 10.0.4、Thunderbird 5.0 至 11.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.x 低于 10.0.4 及 SeaMonkey 低于 2.9 版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0478"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T10:10:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:22Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 12.0 及以上版本（ESR 分支升级至 10.0.4+），Thunderbird 升级至 12.0 及以上版本（ESR 分支升级至 10.0.4+），SeaMonkey 升级至 2.9 及以上版本。如无法升级，可在浏览器中禁用 WebGL（设置 about:config 中 webgl.disabled 为 true）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/48972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49047","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:081","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-30.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53227","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=727547","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75155","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16893","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2012/CVE-2012-0478.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0x