b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-0477.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0063.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0062","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0062.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0475","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 4.x至11.0、Thunderbird 5.0至11.0及SeaMonkey 2.9之前版本在构造Origin和Sec-WebSocket-Origin HTTP头时存在安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过跨站XMLHttpRequest或WebSocket连接，利用包含特定零字段的IPv6地址和非标准端口号，绕过基于IPv6字面地址的访问控制列表（ACL），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要用户交互配合，CVSS评分2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0475"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T10:10:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:22Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 12.0 或更高版本，Thunderbird 升级至 12.0 或更高版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.9 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面配置防火墙规则，阻止来自非标准端口的跨源 WebSocket 和 XHR 请求，并限制 IPv6 地址中零字段压缩格式的 Origin 头传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/48972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49047","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-28.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53230","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=694576","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75153","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16279","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0475.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0475","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0475","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0475","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2