调用 FindMaxElementInSubArray 时使用了错误的模板参数，导致越界读取视频内存中的敏感数据。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 WebGL.drawElements 调用触发该漏洞，从而窃取其他进程或系统在显存中残留的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Firefox 4.x 至 11.0、Firefox ESR 10.x 至 10.0.4、Thunderbird 5.0 至 11.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.x 至 10.0.4 及 SeaMonkey 2.9 之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0473"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T10:10:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:22Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 12.0 及以上版本，Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.4 及以上版本；升级 Thunderbird 至 12.0 及以上版本，Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.4 及以上版本；SeaMonkey 升级至 2.9 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 WebGL 功能（设置 about:config 中 webgl.disabled 为 true）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/48972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49047","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:081","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-26.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53231","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=743475","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16113","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0473.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0473","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0473","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0473","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-0473","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0473.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0473.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-0473","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-0473","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-0473.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0059","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0059.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0472","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey Cairo-Dwrite 字体渲染内存破坏漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 4.x至11.0、Firefox ESR 10.x至10.0.4、Thunderbird 5.0至11.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.x至10.0.4及SeaMonkey 2.9之前版本在Windows Vista/7系统上使用的cairo-dwrite字体渲染实现存在内存破坏漏洞。该漏洞源于cairo-dwrite未正确限制字体渲染操作，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页触发内存损坏，导致浏览器崩溃或执行任意代码。CVSS评分9.3，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0472"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T10:10:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:21Z","remediation":"将 Mozilla Firefox 升级至 12.0 及以上版本（Firefox ESR 升级至 10.0.4 及以上），Thunderbird 升级至 12.0 及以上版本（Thunderbird ESR 升级至 10.0.4 及以上），SeaMonkey 升级至 2.9 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 Windows 系统中禁用 DirectWrite 字体渲染功能作为临时缓解措施：在 Firefox 地址栏输入 about:config，将 gfx.font_rendering.directwrite.enabled 设为 false。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/48972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:081","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-25.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53218","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=744480","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/se