8","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16989","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2012/CVE-2012-0470.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-0470.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0470.json","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-0470.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2012/CVE-2012-0470.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0470","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0470","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/003e8cad66924d61c3369093ab10818154ac5271/CVEs/2012/CVE-2012-0470.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0470","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-0470.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0057.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0056","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0469","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey IndexedDB 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 的 IndexedDB 组件中存在一处释放后重用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，位于 IDBKeyRange::cycleCollection::Trace 函数中。当处理特制的 IndexedDB 数据时，程序未能正确管理内存对象的生命周期，导致已释放的内存指针被再次引用。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含恶意 IndexedDB 数据的网页，触发该内存错误，进而实现任意代码执行。受影响的版本包括 Firefox 4.x 至 11.0、Firefox ESR 10.x 至 10.0.4、Thunderbird 5.0 至 11.0、Thunderbird ESR 10.x 至 10.0.4 以及 SeaMonkey 2.9 之前版本。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0469"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T10:10:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:21Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 12.0 及以上版本（ESR 通道升级至 10.0.4），升级 Thunderbird 至 12.0 及以上版本（ESR 通道升级至 10.0.4），升级 SeaMonkey 至 2.9 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript（设置 about:config 中 dom.indexedDB.enabled 为 false）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/48972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49047","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:081","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-22.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53220","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=738985","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16734","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2012/CVE-2012-0469.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0469.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2012/CVE-2012-0469.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2012/CVE-2012-0469.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2012/CVE-2012-0469.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0469","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0469","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/003e8cad66924d61c3369093ab10818154ac5271/CVEs/2012/CVE-2012-0469.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-0469.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0469"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0054","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-0468","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 浏览器引擎内存破坏漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 4.x至11.0、Thunderbird 5.0至11.0及SeaMonkey 2.9之前版本的浏览器引擎中存在内存破坏漏洞，该漏洞源于jsval.h及js::array_shift函数在处理JavaScript数组操作时存在内存安全缺陷。远程攻击者可诱使用户访问特制网页，触发断言失败及内存破坏，导致浏览器崩溃或实现任意代码执行。攻击无需用户交互，仅需用户通过受影响浏览器访问恶意构造的页面即可触发，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-0468"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T10:10:17Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:37:21Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla Firefox 至 12.0 及以上版本、Thunderbird 至 12.0 及以上版本、SeaMonkey 至 2.9 及以上版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，可禁用 JavaScript（在 Firefox 中设置 about:config → javascript.enabled = false）作为临时缓解措施，但会严重影响正常功能，建议优先完成版本升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://secunia.com/advisories/48972","http://secunia.com/advisories/49047","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:066","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:081","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2012/mfsa2012-20.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53221","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=714616","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A16771","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2012/0xxx/CVE-2012-0468.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-0468","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0468","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-20