buntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-0467","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-0467","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/2880bce38b1c3fec315752297be30e3d60dabff9/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-0467","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-0467.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-0467.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-0467","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2012-0467","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-0467.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0175","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1137","title":"FreeType BDF字体解析堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞","description":"FreeType 字体渲染库在解析 BDF（Bitmap Distribution Format）字体文件时，其 _bdf_list_ensure() 函数存在堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞。FreeType 2.4.9 之前的所有版本均受此漏洞影响，使用受影响版本 FreeType 的应用程序（如 Mozilla Firefox Mobile 10.0.4 之前版本）同样面临风险。远程攻击者可构造一个包含特制表头的恶意 BDF 字体文件，当目标系统使用受影响的应用打开或加载该字体文件时，即可触发内存越界读取，导致应用程序崩溃或内存损坏，攻击者可能借此实现远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分为 9.3，危害等级高。用户应避免打开来源不明的字体文件，并将 FreeType 升级至 2.4.9 或更高版本以消除风险。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1137"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-25T00:00:00Z","updated":"2012-04-25T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 FreeType 至 2.4.9 或更高版本。Linux 发行版用户可通过包管理器更新：Ubuntu/Debian 执行 `sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install freetype`，Red Hat/CentOS 执行 `sudo yum update freetype`。Mozilla Firefox Mobile 用户升级至 10.0.4 或更高版本。Apple iOS 用户升级至 iOS 6.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可禁用 BDF 字体解析作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1137","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1137","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2012-1137","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/7320471f2b3f5194752ce521e7ef043a96e0ce7c/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-1137","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1137.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3355d48a7d0ca0d3b4124274995f7205f0bb89f2/2012/CVE-2012-1137.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-1137.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-1137","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/98c311c3ba3abe1f72f8d5cfae5eb671ae60d00f/tracker/CVE/2012/CVE-2012-1137.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0175.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0246","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0246.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2089","title":"Nginx ngx_http_mp4_module 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"nginx 的 ngx_http_mp4_module 模块在处理 MP4 文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当启用 mp4 指令时，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 MP4 文件触发该漏洞，导致内存覆写，造成拒绝服务或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 nginx 1.0.7 至 1.0.14 及 1.1.3 至 1.1.18 版本，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中危。官方已在 1.0.15 和 1.1.19 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2089"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2012-04-17T21:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:58Z","remediation":"升级 nginx 至 1.0.15 或 1.1.19 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，在 nginx 配置中移除所有 mp4 指令，或使用 `--without-http_mp4_module` 重新编译 nginx 以禁用 mp4 模块，阻止攻击者通过构造的 MP4 文件触发缓冲区溢出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2012-April/079388.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2012-May/079467.html","http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2012-May/079474.html","http://nginx.org/en/security_advisories.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/04/12/9","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52999","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1026924","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74831","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2012/CVE-2012-2089.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2089","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-2089","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2012/CVE-2012-2089.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2012/CVE-2012-2089.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/a424b5e505273e5365b7d0be8eebfa24fc1b2b60/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2012-2089","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2012/CVE-2012-2089.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2012-2089.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2012-2089","https://github.com/mashirozx/Pixiv-Nginx/blob/765ec50d1ab4471e06c1e39742ffd55e0e5dc6d5/docs/CHANGES"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"ha